  "description": "Na Gangnam has been a jobless deadbeat for years, leeching off his poor ol’ mom. But one day, he suddenly decides that he’s going to start being a good son starting the next day.\n\nWhile sleeping, he wakes up from a loud noise and opens his window… but what’s this? Why is there a slime in front of his house?\n\nHe ended up being thrown into a fantasy world along with his entire house?! Gangnam’s journey back home, I mean, to his mother starts now.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=784816), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6743070)",
